{"id":"e7d5f4a8765d8643","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-forcing11-canonical-name-pair.md","title":"ZFC Forcing11 Canonical Name Pair","display":"df-zfc-forcing11-canonical-name-pair — ZFC Forcing11 Canonical Name Pair","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing11-canonical-name-pair","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing11-canonical-name-pair"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing11-canonical-name-pair — ZFC Forcing11 Canonical Name Pair","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-name]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing11-canonical-name-pair"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing11-canonical-name-pair</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing11-canonical-name-pair — ZFC Forcing11 Canonical Name Pair"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"58-df-name\">58-df-name</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> (forcing name)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (forcing poset carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in P\">\\(p\\in P\\)</span> (condition)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> (ordered pair <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\sigma,p\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\sigma,p\\rangle\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}\\)</span> (forcing-name predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"58-df-name\">58-df-name</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11CanonicalNamePair}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11CanonicalNamePair}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}name\\text{-}pair} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11CanonicalNamePair}_S(u,\\sigma,p,P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Name}(\\sigma,P)\\land p\\in P\\land u=\\langle\\sigma,p\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}name\\text{-}pair} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11CanonicalNamePair}_S(u,\\sigma,p,P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Name}(\\sigma,P)\\land p\\in P\\land u=\\langle\\sigma,p\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The forcing carrier is an explicit parameter; a name alone does not determine a unique poset.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-name","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-name]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-name","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Name}$ (forcing-name predicate, see [[58-df-name]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\sigma,p\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Name}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11CanonicalNamePair}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}name\\text{-}pair} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11CanonicalNamePair}_S(u,\\sigma,p,P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Name}(\\sigma,P)\\land p\\in P\\land u=\\langle\\sigma,p\\rangle","display":true}],"bytes":1008,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2023","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-forcing11-canonical-name-pair.md|58-df-zfc-forcing11-canonical-name-pair]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ec28b62254928d73"]}